#: places/templates/places/about.html:33 places/templates/places/about.html:43
msgid "Our Mission"
msgstr "Bizning vazifamiz"

#: places/templates/places/about.html:35
msgid ""
"Halal Korea aims to make life easier for Muslims living in and visiting "
"South Korea by providing a comprehensive platform to find halal food, "
"markets, and prayer spaces."
msgstr ""
"Halal Korea Janubiy Koreyada yashayotgan va tashrif buyuruvchi musulmonlar "
"uchun halol ovqat, bozorlar va namoz joylarini topish uchun keng qamrovli "
"platforma taqdim etish orqali hayotni osonlashtirishni maqsad qiladi."

#: places/templates/places/about.html:38
msgid ""
"We understand the challenges of finding halal options in a new country, and "
"we're here to bridge that gap by connecting our community with verified "
"halal establishments across Korea."
msgstr ""
"Biz yangi mamlakatda halol variantlarni topish qiyinchiliklarini tushunamiz "
"va jamiyatimizni Koreya bo'ylab tasdiqlangan halol muassasalar bilan "
"bog'lash orqali bu bo'shliqni to'ldirish uchun shu yerda turibmiz."

#: places/templates/places/about.html:53
msgid "What We Offer"
msgstr "Nima taklif qilamiz"

#: places/templates/places/about.html:63 places/templates/places/about.html:120
msgid "Community Reviews"
msgstr "Jamiyat sharhlari"

#: places/templates/places/about.html:65
msgid ""
"Real experiences shared by our community members help others make informed "
"decisions."
msgstr ""
"Jamiyat a'zolarimiz tomonidan ulashilgan haqiqiy tajribalar boshqalarga "
"ma'lumotli qarorlar qabul qilishga yordam beradi."

#: places/templates/places/about.html:77
msgid "Multi-Language Support"
msgstr "Ko'p tilli qo'llab-quvvatlash"

#: places/templates/places/about.html:79
msgid "Available in English, Korean, and Uzbek to serve our diverse community."
msgstr ""
"Turli xil jamiyatimizga xizmat qilish uchun ingliz, koreys va o'zbek "
"tillarida mavjud."

#: places/templates/places/about.html:93
msgid "Find Nearby Places"
msgstr "Yaqin joylarni topish"

#: places/templates/places/about.html:95
msgid ""
"Discover halal restaurants, markets, and prayer spaces in your vicinity with "
"our interactive map feature."
msgstr ""
"Interaktiv xarita xususiyatimiz bilan atrofingizdagi halol restoranlar, "
"bozorlar va namoz joylarini kashf eting."

#: places/templates/places/about.html:105
msgid "Our Growing Community"
msgstr "Bizning o'sayotgan jamiyatimiz"

#: places/templates/places/about.html:112
msgid "Community Added Places"
msgstr "Jamiyat tomonidan qo'shilgan joylar"

#: places/templates/places/about.html:128
msgid "Active Users"
msgstr "Faol foydalanuvchilar"

#: places/templates/places/about.html:144
msgid "Important Notice"
msgstr "Muhim eslatma"

#: places/templates/places/about.html:146
msgid ""
"All places listed on our platform are community-contributed. While we make "
"every effort to maintain accurate information, we strongly recommend "
"verifying the halal status directly with each establishment before visiting. "
"Your diligence helps maintain the integrity of our community."
msgstr ""
"Platformamizda keltirilgan barcha joylar jamiyat tomonidan taqdim etilgan. "
"Aniq ma'lumotlarni saqlash uchun har qanday sa'y-harakatni qilgan bo'lsak "
"ham, tashrif buyurishdan oldin har bir muassasa bilan to'g'ridan-to'g'ri "
"halol holatini tekshirishni kuchli tavsiya qilamiz. Sizning "
"tirishqoqligingiz jamiyatimizning yaxlitligini saqlashga yordam beradi."

#: places/templates/places/base.html:19 places/templates/places/base.html:23
msgid ""
"Discover halal restaurants, markets, and prayer spaces across South Korea. "
"Your comprehensive guide to halal dining and Islamic facilities in Korea."
msgstr ""
"Janubiy Koreya bo'ylab halol restoranlar, bozorlar va namoz joylarini kashf "
"eting. Koreyadagi halol ovqatlanish va islomiy muassasalar bo'yicha sizning "
"keng qamrovli yo'riqnomaniz."

